#. module: dwo_sla_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dwo_sla_core.view_sla_definition_form
msgid ""
"Attach this SLA to records that already exist and match the Start Condition."
msgstr "すでに存在し、開始条件に一致するレコードにこのSLAを付与します。"

#. module: dwo_sla_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dwo_sla_core.view_sla_apply_wizard_form
