#. module: dwo_sla_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dwo_sla_core.view_sla_definition_form
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dwo_sla_core.view_sla_definition_list
msgid ""
"Disable this SLA? No new tasks will be created; running tasks keep being "
"tracked."
msgstr "このSLAを無効にしますか？新しいタスクは作成されませんが、実行中のタスクは引き続き追跡されます。"

#. module: dwo_sla_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dwo_sla_core.view_sla_definition_form
